IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0031.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FEE0031C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 WAIVE-IND          PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 MTH-FEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM WAIVE-FEE
    DISPLAY "WAIVE-IND=" WAIVE-IND
    DISPLAY "MTH-FEE=" MTH-FEE
    STOP RUN.
WAIVE-FEE.
    IF ACCT-GOLD-OR-PREMIUM OR TX-MEAN-BAL >= 5000
        MOVE 'Y' TO WAIVE-IND
        MOVE 0.00 TO MTH-FEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 7.50 TO MTH-FEE
    END-IF.
